│    (by using index); if so, and if it contains any thinking or     │
│    redacted_thinking blocks, preserve those blocks exactly as they │
│    appear in that message's content blocks, without dropping or    │
│    altering signatures or fields.                                  │
│  • For all other messages and blocks, keep existing logic.         │
│                                                                    │
